---
import Root from '#/layout/root.astro'
import drb from '#/assets/drb.jpg'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
---

<Root>
  <h1>
    UK Web Designer who loves <span class="highlight">accessibility</span>,
    standards, and designing for <span class="highlight">humans</span>
  </h1>
  <div class="hero with-sidebar">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="text-lg">
        Hi! I'm D. R. Branch, a web designer tk tk tk tk tk tk tk tk tk tk tk tk
        tk
      </p>
      <p>
        (Professional history) Harum in blanditiis vel. Voluptatum sequi et
        molestiae vitae qui est facilis. Quibusdam omnis eum ipsam et quibusdam.
        Provident quia voluptas aperiam quod vel adipisci. Delectus culpa vel
        sit.
      </p>

      <p>
        (A lil bit about me) Qui in atque iste est magnam quo autem. Est et
        dolorum magnam nihil aut pariatur aut est. Voluptatem aut possimus
        officiis ea maxime accusamus libero. Facere rerum vel enim vel
        voluptatem.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar">
      <Image class="hero__image" src={drb} alt="D. R. Branch" loading="eager" />
      <p class="text-sm">Portait Of The Author As A Web Designer</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flow">
    <h2>Project Overviews</h2>
    <div class="grid" data-layout="thirds">
      <div>Card</div>
      <div>Card</div>
      <div>Card</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Root>
